  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.7.1: Bug-fix release. Empty CLI paths report usage errors instead of crashing, and CdflCodec/AVHuff reserve 512 bytes of FLAC frame metadata per frame (was 64), so one-frame-per-hunk CD audio with large Fixed subframes no longer fails with \"FLAC frame too large\". No public API or encoder output changes: 4,221 library tests + 456 encoder tests on each target framework, jb inspectcode 0 findings, CI chdman parity smoke passed. Pure C# - zero native dependencies. Targets net8.0/net9.0/net10.0/net11.0.",
